        <mxCell id="c86" value="&lt;i&gt;The monthly ratio swings from 0.89 to 1.95, while the trailing total moves from 1.18 to its peak and ends at 1.51. In 2026-11 the monthly ratio fell by 0.94, from 1.86 to 0.92, and the trailing total moved by 0.01: the trailing figure is steady and slow to react. The first window includes the start-up month of January 2024. The axis starts at zero.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="464" width="860" height="57" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
